From: Bogdan Mircea <mirceapetrebogdan@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] wave: publish acknowledged native radio policy

Keep WMM, power, RTS, TXOP and airtime policy transactional. Admit the existing
firmware corrections by exact loaded spans, preserve native error propagation
and retain the final observational GET and rollback semantics.

This is the final native integration against the pinned vendor source.
Firmware-dependent policy remains downstream with exact image admission.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: Bogdan Mircea <mirceapetrebogdan@gmail.com>

